    "Completeness comes from SIMULATED objects planted in real SPHEREx images of the injection study's tiles and found (or not) by the unmodified pipeline. Patches the study did not measure are assumed to behave like the pooled study; measured tiles shift the pooled curve by their own 50% magnitude.",
